    "markdown": "# new product catalog (Netbeeper)\n\n- **From:** Example Trading \\<sales@example.com\\>\n- **To:** kay 陳小姐 \\<kay@example.org\\>, Example Trading (tw) \\<sales@example.com\\>, Amy Chan (Example Trading) \\<amy@example.org\\>, Gary Lee \\<gary@example.net\\>\n- **Date:** Fri, 27 Apr 2001 09:44 +0800\n- **Attachments:** I7B02 HTML.htm\n"
